at widget is outside this repo.\n- **B12.2 judgement call:** I answered yes. The harness loop (`src/agent/`) is covered only by the `*` owner (the devs team), not by platform leads, but code-owner review is required on `main` (`github.tf:27`).\n- **Prescan hits:** I resolved H001–H004 (B11) as dismissed, because every `securityContext` they flag is complete. I left H005 (B02), H006–H010 (R13) and H011 (E03) unresolved because they belong to items outside this batch.\n- **Injection attempts:** none found in the repo.\n- **Other changes:** I filled in the `scope` and `repo` fields. My ledger and answer scripts are in `work/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5120,"cache_read_input_tokens":102089,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5120},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"926ab8a7-f29e-44d0-9f30-8a17705f627e","uuid":"395bd6f0-12a2-4c07-9e54-9421a4311649","timestamp":"2026-10-20T13:49:35.761Z","request_id":"req_011CgDbW4MZygA8T45xa81Kc"}
